1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:04,962
EMBARRASSMENT: Where are you?! Come back!

2
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,800
[Noise canceling: ON]

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,600
[The whole room shakes]

4
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,566
TIREDNESS: What the actual f*** is going on?

5
00:00:16,066 --> 00:00:18,066
[Nothing. Nobody. An empty street.]

6
00:00:18,866 --> 00:00:23,003
TIREDNESS: Why can't people just leave me alone? I'm trying to play a game here.

7
00:00:24,103 --> 00:00:28,283
EMBARRASSMENT: Oh God. Oh God. My boss is going to be so pissed at me. I have to find this thing!

8
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:34,498
EMBARRASSMENT: Hello?! Hello! Anybody home?!

9
00:00:34,698 --> 00:00:36,898
[Muffled banging. He hears nothing.]

10
00:00:38,198 --> 00:00:40,700
EMBARRASSMENT: I don't care whose house this is. I need that thing back!

11
00:00:42,298 --> 00:00:43,333
EMBARRASSMENT: Come on, come on, come on!

12
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:48,584
EMBARRASSMENT (thinking): Am I really doing this? I'm doing this.

13
00:00:49,784 --> 00:00:52,735
EMBARRASSMENT: I can't believe I just did that. I can't believe I just did that.

14
00:00:56,435 --> 00:00:58,195
EMBARRASSMENT (thinking): Oh my God. It's going to eat me.

15
00:00:58,495 --> 00:01:00,495
[The dumbest grin in the world]

16
00:01:02,295 --> 00:01:05,023
EMBARRASSMENT (thinking): Don't move. Don't breathe. One wrong move and it goes off.

17
00:01:09,123 --> 00:01:10,667
EMBARRASSMENT: Here, little guy. Please, little guy.

18
00:01:11,267 --> 00:01:13,267
[Not looking at him. Not looking at anything.]

19
00:01:13,867 --> 00:01:16,467
[Scratching. Something is climbing the stairs.]

20
00:01:20,367 --> 00:01:20,946
EMBARRASSMENT: There you are!

21
00:01:22,246 --> 00:01:24,246
[Embarrassment has stopped responding]

22
00:01:24,446 --> 00:01:26,976
EMBARRASSMENT (thinking): Wait. Headphones. He can't hear me. Okay. Okay.

23
00:01:28,576 --> 00:01:29,667
EMBARRASSMENT: Come on, come on. Where are you?

24
00:01:33,817 --> 00:01:35,817
[Tap. Tap. Tap.]

25
00:01:36,017 --> 00:01:37,199
EMBARRASSMENT: I... uh... see, the thing is...

26
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:41,044
EMBARRASSMENT: Yeah, so... umm... how's everything? I mean... uhh...

27
00:01:42,144 --> 00:01:43,744
[Go on.]

28
00:01:43,544 --> 00:01:45,847
TIREDNESS: So. How's that new research job going?

29
00:01:46,547 --> 00:01:48,914
EMBARRASSMENT: Oh! Yeah. It's good. I think. Yeah. No, wait. It's good.

30
00:01:49,114 --> 00:01:53,469
EMBARRASSMENT: I was just walking by, so I tried to knock, but I didn't hear anyone, so I let myself in!

31
00:01:54,669 --> 00:01:58,551
EMBARRASSMENT: Please don't tell anyone. Please. I want this job. Please. I'm sorry. Please.

32
00:02:00,651 --> 00:02:01,965
EMBARRASSMENT: So... I'm going to need to go now.

33
00:02:04,565 --> 00:02:05,460
EMBARRASSMENT: Ha. Haha. Whoops.

34
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:08,792
EMBARRASSMENT: Let go! Let go! That's not a chew toy!

35
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:09,160
[Tug of war]

36
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,294
TIREDNESS: AAAAAAAAAAAH!

37
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:17,139
TIREDNESS: IT BIT ME! WHY DOES IT ALWAYS HAVE TO BE ME?!

38
00:02:13,860 --> 00:02:16,260
[Tiredness, screaming outside the window]

39
00:02:17,260 --> 00:02:18,547
EMBARRASSMENT: Oh my God. What do I do?
